      <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">When you use our website or book a trip, we may collect:</p>
      <ul style="margin-bottom:32px;padding-left:24px;list-style:disc;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Personal details</strong> — name, email address, phone number, nationality, passport information (for visa support), and travel preferences you provide via our forms or communications.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Technical data</strong> — IP address, browser type, device information, and browsing patterns collected via cookies and analytics tools.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Payment data</strong> — processed securely through our payment providers; we never store full credit card numbers on our servers.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul style="margin-bottom:32px;padding-left:24px;list-style:disc;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">To design and deliver your tailor-made travel itinerary</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">To process bookings, payments, and visa support documents</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">To communicate with you about your trip and respond to inquiries</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">To improve our website, services, and customer experience</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">To comply with legal obligations in China and your country of residence</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. We share data only with: hotel and transport partners necessary to deliver your trip; licensed guides assigned to your journey; payment processors for secure transactions; and legal authorities when required by law.</p>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">4. Data Security</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">We implement industry-standard encryption (SSL/TLS), access controls, and secure storage to protect your data. All online payments are processed through PCI-compliant gateways. While no system is completely immune, we take every reasonable measure to safeguard your information.</p>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">Our website uses essential cookies for site functionality and optional analytics cookies to understand how visitors use the site. You may disable non-essential cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some site features.</p>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to: access the personal data we hold about you; request correction or deletion of your data; withdraw consent for data processing; request data portability. To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:zjonny338@gmail.com">zjonny338@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      
      <h2 class="display-h2" style="font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:20px;">7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:32px;">We retain your personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined above or as required by law. Booking records are retained for 5 years for tax and legal compliance. You may request earlier deletion subject to legal requirements.</p>
      
